Since the log bandwidth optimisation is inplace where it uploads the critical log statements in a service. While updating old updateEngine is being triggered where it could not create the logs in updater_c folder, In this case all logs will be there in updater folder where those logs stored in non critical logs. 

Because we need updater logs,Through one-time RAR task that would move the updater log from updater folder to updater_c folder at the end of OTA Update process 

For this to make keep alive manager not to upload to critical logs when logs are being in updater folder, 
modify the keepalive count for +2 if the count value is at 0 or 8, 9. 
